(text "U401 runs as a DFP: PORT high, ADDR open (GPIO mode), CURRENT_MODE 499k advertises 1.5 A.\nID goes low when a sink attaches and turns on U402, which limits VBUS to 1.7 A.\nVBUS_EN low holds CC_EN_N high, so the port stays off until the CM5 enables USB power.\nU401 sources VCONN from 5V; C401 is its bulk capacitor (10 µF minimum).\nTX1 and TX2 reach the receptacle with swapped polarity, as on the main board; USB 3 receivers correct it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d701f210-5586-4d8a-b96f-6991713d2366"))
